{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "39c9ae03-eb33-86ac-9c2d-2d3ec7290631",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:06:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:03:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Kevin. My name is Terrence Cullen. I'm calling about the water behind my building. It's at 261 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 261 Eustis. Go ahead, what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the parking lot in back slopes toward the back door. Every time it rains hard the whole lot drains right to the entrance and it floods. After that nor'easter that ended Saturday, three days ago, I had water right up to the door again. Again, you know? This keeps happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Parking lot pitching toward the back entrance, water pooling at the door. Did it get inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It came up on the threshold. Didn't come all the way in this time, but close. And there's something else. [pause] There's a manhole cover out there that looks off by an inch. Like it's sitting higher on one side, or not seated right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm writing that down. Manhole cover not sitting flush, about an inch off, in the same lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, same lot, toward the middle. I don't know if it's got anything to do with the water, but somebody's gonna trip on it or a car's gonna hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair. Is the lot city property or private, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...sorry, you cut out. Mãe, um momentu, mi ta na telefone. Sorry, my mother's here. Say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I asked if the lot belongs to the city or if it's private."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm the homeowner of the building, so I figured it's ours, but the drain it goes to, that's the street system, right? That's why I'm calling you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. I'll log it so a crew can look at the drain and that cover, and we'll see whose it is. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0161. Terrence Cullen, 261 Eustis Avenue, lot drains to the back door, plus the manhole cover."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Can I ask, do the crews work on weekends? Because it's always some weekend storm and then nobody shows till the middle of the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a big storm they're out whenever they're needed, but they're stretched thin and they go to emergencies first. Yours would go on the list for a look this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:05:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just want somebody to actually come. I'm tired of mopping out the doorway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks, Kevin. By the way, the bike path out at Sachuest Point is lovely for a walk, if you ever get the chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll keep that in mind. Take care, Terrence."
    }
  ],
